# TEMPLATE — UI Install download is tenant-start.env (do not commit secrets).
# Full guide: README.md at repo root (Part A → Connected → Part B).
#
# Part A — Connect Agent (UI Steps 1–5):
#   1. Get installer → connect-agent/kubernetes/
#   2. CA → Download → ca.crt (Gateway CA)
#   3. Save THIS file HERE with ca.crt + tenant-start.sh + daemonset.yaml
#   4. Ensure BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN is set
#   5. ./tenant-start.sh ./tenant-start.env
#
# STOP until UI shows Connected, then Part B:
#   Refresh → cd ../../agent && ./deploy-agent.sh → registrations
#   → Resources: name for this tenant + base_url from Connect-tab dial
#
# CA_CERT_FILE=./ca.crt is relative to this directory (not Downloads).

# TENANT_NAMESPACE=<TENANT_ID>-<ENVIRONMENT_ID first 26 chars>  # optional if ENVIRONMENT_ID set
TENANT_ID=<TENANT_ID>
ENVIRONMENT_ID=<ENVIRONMENT_ID>
FABRIC_GATEWAY_ADDRESS=<FABRIC_GATEWAY_ADDRESS>
# FABRIC_TLS_SERVER_NAME=<FABRIC_TLS_SERVER_NAME>
FABRIC_CONTROL_PLANE_URL=<FABRIC_CONTROL_PLANE_URL>
CONNECT_AGENT_IMAGE=<CONNECT_AGENT_IMAGE>
CA_CERT_FILE=./ca.crt
BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN=<BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN>
# SAAS_NAMESPACE=<SAAS_NAMESPACE>   # hybrid only
# SKIP_NETWORK_POLICY=0
